31", "uri": "https://scontent-sin6-3.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499298467_1684679832191697_7907575370902159542_n.png?_nc_cat=106&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=tQRQL8xOVmUQ7kNvwFQr6a4&_nc_oc=AdouC5L7FDsIMfrabgQtFIS5GaTTkXPhBnfEv2c8RMY4zTZ1EzYMcU9PeDph9Bsul-U&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sin6-3.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQHxkNemo69A-rrntO050dI4NsVfnSh0HM931If4WQ8I1Q&oe=6A7DB6A6"}, {"file_name": "com.oculus.vrshell-20250718-161859.png", "id": "1835197684012573", "uri": "https://scontent-sin6-3.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499301053_1835197687345906_3873692057525823371_n.png?_nc_cat=106&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=dCIv8uhSw08Q7kNvwEqS4xM&_nc_oc=AdrZyLk-blQZeluEGTEe0DA86t-7vHjb47K2fMl_UwZdmbrfanK_ol97IjAazFvA-oo&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sin6-3.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQHgvb-nn7HM9vkhJPEeogvviv886SvL5iimWqqsKpSVvA&oe=6A7DCA72"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": null, "display_name": "Pharmacy Technician", "keywords": ["Pharmacy", "immerselearn", "VR", "Training"], "long_description": "Pharmacy Technician is a hands-on VR training experience designed to simulate real-world pharmacy operations. Explore tasks like processing prescriptions, measuring and dispensing medications, handling inventory, managing recalls, and preventing common medication errors. Whether you're a student or professional, this interactive simulation builds essential skills in a safe, immersive environment. Developed with industry standards in mind, it\u2019s perfect for educational institutions and pharmacy tech programs.", "short_description": "Step into the world of pharmacy with Pharmacy Technician, an immersive VR training app. Learn prescription processing, medication dispensing, inventory management, and error prevention in a realistic and interactive virtual environment."}]}, "developer_name": null, "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://immerselearn.com/privacy-policy/", "developer_terms_of_service_url": null, "publisher_name": "ImmerseLearn", "support_websi